[TITLE]
BND-04: storage SU1 drains through C1 to outfall O1. For 2 h SU1 gets 1 cfs at
10 mg/L, then the inflow stops and the outfall stage rises to 3 ft, so water
flows back from O1 into SU1, carrying O1's last concentration (10 mg/L).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             08:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         5
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth Shape      Coeff Expon Const SurDepth Fevap
SU1    0    10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     20000 0        0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name Elev Type       Stage
O1     0    TIMESERIES STAGE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length Rough InOff OutOff InitFlow
C1     SU1  O1 200    0.013 0     0      0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 2 0 0 0 1

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name Units Crain Cgw Crdii Kdecay SnowOnly CoPoll CoFrac Cdwf Cinit
P1     MG/L  0     0   0     0      NO       *      0      0    0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node Param TSeries Type   Mfactor Sfactor Baseline
SU1    FLOW  QIN     FLOW   1.0     1.0     0
SU1    P1    ""      CONCEN 1.0     1.0     10

[TIMESERIES]
QIN    01/01/2020  00:00  1.0
QIN    01/01/2020  02:00  1.0
QIN    01/01/2020  02:01  0.0
QIN    01/01/2020  08:00  0.0
STAGE  01/01/2020  00:00  0.0
STAGE  01/01/2020  02:00  0.0
STAGE  01/01/2020  02:30  3.0
STAGE  01/01/2020  08:00  3.0

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
